@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11
|Sales Employee|
start
:Search order by order number or customer name;
|System|
if (Order(s) found?) then ([yes])
  :Show list of orders;
  |Sales Employee|
  :Select order;
  |System|
  :Show status, order lines,\nbackorders and delivery time;
  stop
else ([no])
  :Show message no order found;
  stop
endif
@enduml
